# Room folders — everything you generate while attacking a box lives here.
# Scans, notes, cracked creds, flags, writeups, downloaded tools: all
# git-ignored so nothing target-specific or sensitive ever gets committed.
rooms/*

# ...but keep the empty rooms/ directory itself in the repo so it exists
# after a fresh clone.
!rooms/
!rooms/.gitkeep

# Common local cruft
*.log
tools/
